    "note": "As passed by the House (02_PH), vote 71-24 on 2025-05-21; later Senate or conference changes are not in the text read. In R.C. 2923.13(B)(2) 'third' degree is struck and 'fourth' added. Also raises R.C. 2941.146 (discharging from a motor vehicle) from five to seven years, adds new R.C. 2941.1428/2941.1429 specifications, and amends 2923.125 and the BCI background-check sections."
